;; karakuri (絡繰) service capability + ToS registry — :representative (R0, G8).
;; Each record drives adapter-tier selection (T1 official-API preferred) and the G2 ToS gate:
;; a :tos-stance of :automation-prohibited refuses the T2 headless-browser adapter by construction.
;; This is policy/capability data, NOT an endorsement. karakuri drives only the MEMBER's OWN account
;; (G1) and holds no credential (G3). ToS stances are :representative and MUST be operator-verified
;; before any live use (G6); a vendor can change its ToS at any time.
[{:service/id "squarespace"
